How many lines are counted before the temporary file is deleted?

```java
var path = java.nio.file.Files.createTempFile("expenses-", ".txt");
try {
  java.nio.file.Files.writeString(path, "Food:1250\nBus:300\n", java.nio.charset.StandardCharsets.UTF_8);
  try (var lines = java.nio.file.Files.lines(path, java.nio.charset.StandardCharsets.UTF_8)) {
    System.out.println(lines.count());
  }
} finally {
  java.nio.file.Files.deleteIfExists(path);
}
```
